00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,000
Why break your pride

290
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,280
for others?

291
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:34,980
Nature has its own beauty;

292
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:37,280
why seek validation from others?

293
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,600
Your bone-piercing pain

294
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,200
wasn't brought by the rouge.

295
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:42,640
It's your own making.

296
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:44,040
You insisted on making this world

297
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:45,280
force all women

298
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:47,200
into the same mold,

299
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:48,800
including yourself.

300
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,000
You...

301
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,200
You...

302
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,440
My Lord.

303
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,240
You...

304
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:59,120
You...

305
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:05,080
Yi.

306
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,960
Do you want to know

307
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,120
how your mother died?

308
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:13,720
Come here,

309
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:16,160
let Mother tell you.

310
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:18,120
My mother's death...

311
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:21,800
Come.

312
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:57,720
Lady Li!

313
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,880
Harboring a monster,

314
00:16:00,880 --> 00:16:02,280
murdering innocent people,

315
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:03,840
and bringing chaos to Kuizhou.

316
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:05,300
Execute her immediately.

317
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,080
Take her

318
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:09,440
to the mass grave.

319
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,760
Please be wise, Governor.

320
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:22,620
I risk my life to advise you again.

321
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:24,480
In the name of the Zuirong Cult, Lady Li

322
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:26,360
not only publicly executed thin women,

323
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:28,600
but also caused all the ladies in Kuizhou

324
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,960
to harm themselves for the beauty of plumpness.

325
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:32,560
Some took weight-gain drugs

326
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:34,240
for three consecutive months,

327
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,600
leading to heart failure.

328
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:37,080
Some were force-fed

329
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:38,880
until their stomachs burst.

330
00:16:38,920 --> 00:16:40,120
How is this beauty?

331
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:42,640
This is clearly a murder weapon.

332
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,320
This is the list of deceased victims

333
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:47,120
of the Zuirong Cult that I investigated secretly.

334
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:49,460
Two hundred and nineteen people,

335
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:51,680
every one of them with a name.

336
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,280
Bring it up.

337
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:19,060
To think such a tragedy has happened.

338
00:17:20,359 --> 00:17:21,760
I implore you, Governor,

339
00:17:21,760 --> 00:17:23,359
to abolish this evil decree.

340
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:26,079
Announce to all of Kuizhou that

341
00:17:26,079 --> 00:17:27,210
the beauty of a woman

342
00:17:27,319 --> 00:17:28,560
lies not in being plump or thin,

343
00:17:28,560 --> 00:17:30,400
but in the brilliance of her character.

344
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:33,320
Let the ladies of Kuizhou be beautiful in their own way.

345
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:34,120
This action

346
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:36,400
will not only comfort the souls of these over 200 victims

347
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,480
in heaven,

348
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:41,440
but also establish your reputation for benevolent governance.

349
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:44,480
Granted.

350
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:46,080
From today on,

351
00:17:46,280 --> 00:17:48,000
the Zuirong Cult is abolished.

352
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,560
For all women in Kuizhou,

353
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:52,320
their worth will no longer be judged by their figure.

354
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:57,840
You are wise, Governor.

355
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:02,530
Let's go see.

356
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,360
The notice!

357
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:06,760
Let me see.

358
00:18:09,320 --> 00:18:10,600
By the order of the Governor,

359
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:11,530
the Zuirong Cult

360
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:13,040
violates human nature

361
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:14,600
and is abolished effective immediately.

362
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:15,800
From this day on,

363
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:17,120
the women of Kuizhou,

364
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,200
whether plump or thin,

365
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:19,480
can all pursue their own ambitions.

366
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:22,960
Great!

367
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:23,840
It's canceled.

368
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,520
It really is.

369
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:28,200
I can walk on the streets openly from now on!

370
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:31,880
I no longer need to wear this junk every day to pretend to be fat!

371
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:33,320
Wonderful!

372
00:18:36,120 --> 00:18:36,200
3 days later.
